    {
      "subId": "37402",
      "subQuestName": "See how Venti borrows the Holy Lyre",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "3740201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "3740201": {
            "id": "3740201",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "Let me handle this...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3740202"
            ]
          },
          "3740202": {
            "id": "3740202",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "Hello there, Sister.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3740203"
            ]
          },
          "3740203": {
            "id": "3740203",
            "speakerId": 1161,
            "speakerName": "Gotelinde",
            "text": "May the Anemo God bless you, young bard. How can I help you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3740204"
            ]
          },
          "3740204": {
            "id": "3740204",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "Actually, I know a secret that can save Mondstadt from its current predicament.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3740205"
            ]
          },
          "3740205": {
            "id": "3740205",
            "speakerId": 1161,
            "speakerName": "Gotelinde",
            "text": "Oh, what a blessing from the God of Anemo!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3740206"
            ]
          },
          "3740206": {
            "id": "3740206",
            "speakerId": 1161,
            "speakerName": "Gotelinde",
            "text": "But you should report that to the Knights of Favonius. Why have you come to me?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3740207"
            ]
          },
          "3740207": {
            "id": "3740207",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "Hahaha, because you, dear sister, are able to help!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3740208"
            ]
          },
          "3740208": {
            "id": "3740208",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "I'd like to borrow... the Holy Lyre. With it, I'll be able to help Stormterror—",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3740209"
            ]
          },
          "3740209": {
            "id": "3740209",
            "speakerId": 1161,
            "speakerName": "Gotelinde",
            "text": "Please see yourselves out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3740210"
            ]
          },
          "3740210": {
            "id": "3740210",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "What?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3740211"
            ]
          },
          "3740211": {
            "id": "3740211",
            "speakerId": 1161,
            "speakerName": "Gotelinde",
            "text": "It's a vicious dragon indeed, but once the Acting Grand Master makes up her mind, nothing can stand in the Knights' way.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3740212"
            ]
          },
          "3740212": {
            "id": "3740212",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "That's simply not acceptable. Wouldn't Stormterror end up getting killed that way?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3740213"
            ]
          },
          "3740213": {
            "id": "3740213",
            "speakerId": 1161,
            "speakerName": "Gotelinde",
            "text": "That foolish beast betrayed the winds. Not even the God of Anemo themselves would forgive it!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3740214"
            ]
          },
          "3740214": {
            "id": "3740214",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "Wow...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3740215"
            ]
          },
          "3740215": {
            "id": "3740215",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "Please, I beg of you!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3740216"
            ]
          },
          "3740216": {
            "id": "3740216",
            "speakerId": 1161,
            "speakerName": "Gotelinde",
            "text": "I'm afraid not, little bard.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3740217"
            ]
          },
          "3740217": {
            "id": "3740217",
            "speakerId": 1161,
            "speakerName": "Gotelinde",
            "text": "(Strange... Somehow I feel so bad rejecting this sweet child...)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3740218"
            ]
          },
          "3740218": {
            "id": "3740218",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "Then... I guess I'm left with no other choice.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3740219"
            ]
          },
          "3740219": {
            "id": "3740219",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "I cannot hide anymore!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3740220"
            ]
          },
          "3740220": {
            "id": "3740220",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "My disciples, rejoice! Behold, the <color=#00E1FFFF>God of Anemo, Barbatos</color> has descended!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3740221"
            ]
          },
          "3740221": {
            "id": "3740221",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "Shocked, aren't you? Don't you just want to cry out and rejoice? How does it feel to finally meet the god you've been serving?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3740222"
            ]
          },
          "3740222": {
            "id": "3740222",
            "speakerId": 1161,
            "speakerName": "Gotelinde",
            "text": "If there's nothing else, I'll be going back to handle the Cathedral's paperwork now.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3740223"
            ]
          },
          "3740223": {
            "id": "3740223",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "Wait—"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "37403",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "3740301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "3740301": {
            "id": "3740301",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "Eh? She didn't even bat an eyelid.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3740302"
            ]
          },
          "3740302": {
            "id": "3740302",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "But, I have at least learned what I wanted to know.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3740303"
            ]
          },
          "3740303": {
            "id": "3740303",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "She didn't deny that the Cathedral is enshrining the Holy Lyre.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3740304"
            ]
          },
          "3740304": {
            "id": "3740304",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "#Now, {NICKNAME}, since you're the hotshot of the Knights of Favonius...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "3740305"
            ]
          },
          "3740305": {
            "id": "3740305",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "Maybe you can give it a shot."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "37404",
